abstract: >-
  Early-stage clinical pilot of an adaptive system that leverages LLMs to
  generate personalized questionnaires for suicide risk assessment under
  continuous clinician supervision (KLIMAKA, Athens, Greece). Combines
  LLM-driven generation, fuzzy-logic adaptation, and patient history.
